# mix: MMI, 8 frames per iteration. Per voice pmulth of the samples and the
# left (then right) volume in 8 halfwords: the even frames' products in rd, the
# odd ones' by pmfhl.uw; each psraw 15, paddw into the sums of the even and odd
# frames. pmaxw/pminw saturate, pinteh pairs left and right, pextlw/pextuw
# order the frames. The volume vectors are on the stack.
